  "releaseNotes": "1.0.10:\n- Memory leak fix: add finalizer to MmapManager with GC.KeepAlive to prevent mmap leak on Reload().\n- Reload atomicity: compare against _publishedEpoch instead of in-flight _reloadEpoch.\n- IPv6 performance: zero-alloc single-pass address decoding (-41% latency).\n- 100% backward compatible with 1.0.9.",
